---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section analogy-stories" aria-labelledby="analogy-title"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="story-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The PinnacleAI paradigm shift</p><h2 id="analogy-title">Build the skills.<br /><em>Keep the whole life in view.</em></h2><p>Growing independence. Taking part in school. Feeling included. We work toward a self-sufficient, mainstream life for your child. That purpose gives every step its direction.</p></div>
