        <div class="skill-bricks"><span>Ask</span><span>Choose</span><span>Join in</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="scene-kicker"><Icon name="home" size={20} />The home</p><h3>Bricks build the house.<br /><em>Life makes it a home.</em></h3><p>Therapy builds individual skills. Those skills find their purpose in your child’s life—asking for help, making friends and doing more for themselves.</p>
      <strong class="scene-takeaway">Plan around the life. Build toward it.</strong>
    </article>
