      <p class="scene-kicker"><Icon name="compass" size={20} />The journey</p><h3>A car needs good parts.<br /><em>A journey needs a destination.</em></h3><p>Therapy methods are the working parts of care. Your child’s plan connects them around a direction: communication, participation and growing independence.</p>
      <strong class="scene-takeaway">Know the direction. Review. Adjust.</strong>
